  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JP Pacific Insurance and Climate Adaptation Programme (PICAP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Pacific Insurance Climate Adaptation Programme is to improve the financial preparedness of Pacific Small Island Developing States households, communities, small businesses, organizations and governments towards climate change and natural hazards through a combination of stakeholder engagement, co-creation of solutions, awareness and capacity building, innovative financing options and digital linkages &#x2013; with a robust interface to the 2030 Sustainable Development Goals.</narrative>
  </description>
